  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "* Reduced code duplication in ``ProcessInvoker`` implementation class\n* Added support for Graceful Cancellation via Interrupt Signals on Unix (#236) ,addressing #231 \n* Updated ``ProcessConfigurationFactory`` to use default ``ArgumentsBuilder`` validation\n* Updated ``ArgumentsBuilder`` logic to allow setting empty arguments\n* Removed unnecessary Process ``HasStarted`` internal helper method - ``ProcessWrapper``'s ``HasStarted`` property is used instead\n* Moved more ``ProcessWrapper`` configuration logic into ``ProcessWrapper`` from ``ProcessInvoker``\n* Replaced manual ``ArgumentOutOfRangeException`` instantiation and throwing with cleaner Throw method calls\n* Updated internal Polyfill version from 9.5.0 to 9.7.0\n* Updated DotExtensions version from 9.3.0 to 9.3.1",
  "repository": "",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
